  "description": "A punchline or extension of the 'men are pigs' stereotype, implying that while all men are pigs, some are more overtly or aggressively animalistic than others. This reinforces the idea of men as inherently brutish and adds a layer of comparative insult, often used to target specific men or groups of men who are perceived as particularly aggressive or crude.",
